        "TileImage": "$($repository 5d442b15-9a98-484f-881c-abe19f19838d).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47 today we are headed to a place known as paris, There is a stylist who lurks in the shadows but later he will try and steal the anceint cutlasses next to him eliminate him cleanly. Helmut kruger Is helping providence by distracting fellow ica agents. He should be by his helicopter at the north part of the area. His body gaurd should be right behing him by the helicopter, he is a target because hes a second in command so it wont do anything if only kruger is killed, Eliminate the gaurd.",
